    <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts temporal validity from German legal text and metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Recognises patterns such as:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;in Kraft getreten am DD.MM.YYYY&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;tritt am DD.MM.YYYY in Kraft&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;gilt ab DD.MM.YYYY&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;außer Kraft getreten am DD.MM.YYYY&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;aufgehoben mit Wirkung vom DD.MM.YYYY&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ISO 8601 date literals in metadata JSON</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>German month names and numeric &quot;DD.MM.YYYY&quot; are normalised to ISO 8601. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
